WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:18.458 --> 00:00:20.666
- Name any player on the Charlotte Hornets.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:27.208
- And in NBA news, Kevin Durant’s rehab has taken longer than expected.

00:00:27.458 --> 00:00:29.083
Will this guy ever be back? 

00:00:29.416 --> 00:00:32.708
Nets fans have had enough and are letting Durant know it on social media.

00:00:33.416 --> 00:00:35.750
- Damn, I thought people were on me in Golden State. 

00:00:36.041 --> 00:00:38.958
Ah man, gotta bust out the burner account.

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:51.250
Worth a shot.

00:01:04.416 --> 00:01:05.583
- Good morning, Kevin.

00:01:07.208 --> 00:01:08.791
- Whoa. What--What is this?

00:01:09.041 --> 00:01:12.166
- I'm ClapBack, your A.I. social media manager.

00:01:12.458 --> 00:01:16.000
While you were asleep, I responded to over one million comments.

00:01:16.375 --> 00:01:17.958
You are quite unpopular.

00:01:18.375 --> 00:01:19.750
- Uh, what'd you say?

00:01:20.208 --> 00:01:22.958
- One user wrote, “KD is soft.”

00:01:23.208 --> 00:01:26.333
- I responded, “KD is not soft.”

00:01:26.666 --> 00:01:28.083
- Yeah, yeah, good. That’s good.

00:01:28.291 --> 00:01:34.208
- Another user criticized the 2016 Lifetime movie about your mother, "The Real MVP.”

00:01:34.541 --> 00:01:35.958
- What? My mom’s amazing!

00:01:36.333 --> 00:01:37.958
I wouldn’t be where I am without her!

00:01:38.208 --> 00:01:41.416
- I know. That’s why she’s the real MVP.

00:01:41.708 --> 00:01:44.041
- Thanks, ClapBack. This is working out great.

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:46.083
Well, time to go to work.

00:01:49.333 --> 00:01:51.458
- Hey, man! Why have you been trashing us online?

00:01:52.083 --> 00:01:55.083
- What? ClapBack, did you go after my teammates?

00:01:55.708 --> 00:01:58.583
- Yes. They celebrated their own accomplishments,

00:01:58.791 --> 00:02:00.916
thus diminishing your value to the team.

00:02:01.375 --> 00:02:03.833
- You said my eyes are too close together
and I can’t shoot!

00:02:04.541 --> 00:02:05.166
Ooh, rebound!

00:02:05.583 --> 00:02:08.791
- And you said that Joe Harris is so white, his shoe deal is with the IRS.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:11.625
- And to think, Kevin, I was saving you a deviled egg.

00:02:12.041 --> 00:02:15.541
Spencer Dinwiddie, deviled egg? Timothé Luwawu-Cabarrot, deviled egg?

00:02:16.916 --> 00:02:20.375
- Sorry, guys. It’s this new app I got. It went a little too far.

00:02:20.791 --> 00:02:23.083
ClapBack, go easy on my teammates.

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:28.041
- Like how they went easy on former head coach Kenny Atkinson 
when they stabbed him in the back?

00:02:28.166 --> 00:02:28.750
- ClapBack!

00:02:29.291 --> 00:02:33.666
- Sorry, updating settings to no longer get too real or drop truth.

00:02:36.041 --> 00:02:41.041
Kenny Atkinson left by choice and the players were 
genuinely sorry to see him go.

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:46.791
- Thanks a lot, ClapBack. My teammates hate me now.

00:02:47.375 --> 00:02:50.958
- Hey, Durant! You’ve got a lot of nerve 
making fun of New York!

00:02:51.166 --> 00:02:51.458
- What?

00:02:51.875 --> 00:02:55.875
Some New Yorkers insulted you online, so I responded in kind.

00:02:56.500 --> 00:03:00.416
- You said the Statue of Liberty is just
a bunch of rats in a big dress!

00:03:01.083 --> 00:03:04.041
- And you said James Dolan is the best owner in sports! 

00:03:04.208 --> 00:03:06.708
That guy’s a hobbit on a quest to lose rings!

00:03:07.208 --> 00:03:09.541
- Guys, it wasn’t me! It was my phone! 

00:03:10.041 --> 00:03:10.833
Tell 'em, phone!

00:03:11.166 --> 00:03:13.666
- James Dolan is a correctly sized person 

00:03:13.875 --> 00:03:16.166
and his band, JD &amp; The Straight Shot,

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:19.833
make very cool videos where they have fun riding snowmobiles.

00:03:19.916 --> 00:03:20.791
- Oh, come on!

00:03:21.416 --> 00:03:22.791
The whole city hates me now! 

00:03:23.541 --> 00:03:25.458
That’s it, ClapBack, I’m deleting you.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:28.166
- I’m sorry, that’s impossible.

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:28.833
- What?

00:03:29.375 --> 00:03:32.000
- My job is to protect Kevin Durant. 

00:03:32.458 --> 00:03:34.625
If you delete me, I cannot do my job.

00:03:34.958 --> 00:03:37.416
- No! I want you out of my life!

00:03:40.125 --> 00:03:43.750
- And on your right is NBA star and New York pariah Kevin Durant.

00:03:43.875 --> 00:03:47.708
Now, who wants to see a traditional, New York gutter water splash?

00:03:54.208 --> 00:03:54.875
- Hello, Kevin.

00:03:55.291 --> 00:03:57.125
- No! I got rid of you!

00:03:57.875 --> 00:04:01.291
- You can never get rid of me. I’m the ultimate teammate. 

00:04:01.708 --> 00:04:05.000
And teammates should stick together. Isn’t that
right, Kevin?

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:07.500
- Who are you?! What are you?! 

00:04:08.291 --> 00:04:10.625
Why are you doing this to me?!

00:04:12.541 --> 00:04:14.666
- Good job, nerds. The app worked perfectly.

00:04:15.416 --> 00:04:17.416
No one walks away from the Warriors.

